# Flat synthesis for area (build-plan.md S7.1). Rendered by synth/run_synth.py.
# Fairness rule: only the RTL sources, the top module, ALIGN_W, and the abc -D target change between formats.
# -noalumacc on every unit: otherwise synth fuses the 32 multipliers and the tree into one $macc and ABC
# takes minutes (MXINT8 >17 min); kept separate it finishes in seconds with equal or smaller netlists.
# -constr on every unit: without it Yosys hands ABC a genlib with unit gate delays, so -D counts logic
# levels, not picoseconds, and any target above the depth is a no-op. With it ABC reads the liberty
# and maps, buffers, and sizes against real timing; the driver and load are the same for all units.
read_liberty -lib {LIB}
read_verilog -sv {SOURCES}
{CHPARAM}
hierarchy -check -top {TOP}
synth -top {TOP} -flatten -noalumacc
dfflibmap -liberty {LIB}
abc -liberty {LIB}{ABC_CONSTR} {DTARGET}
opt_clean
tee -o {OUT}_stat.txt stat -liberty {LIB}
tee -q -o {OUT}_stat.json stat -json -liberty {LIB}
delete t:$scopeinfo
write_verilog -noattr -noexpr -nohex -nodec {OUT}_netlist.v
